    "caption": "🥳 Exciting News: Omnitep is now a partner of Astana Hub!\n\n💫 The Omnitep Platform is a next-generation, powerful, scalable, and secure Auto-Code (AI-based) development ecosystem that seamlessly integrates low-code, no-code, and zero-code capabilities. Empower your team with a one-stop solution for swift development, delivery, and evolution of robust cloud-based applications.\n\nSay goodbye to the complexities of multiple coding languages and development tools. Omnitep streamlines the process, eliminating the need for specialized expertise.\n\n🌟 Key Business Benefits:\n- Faster time to market\n- Build more with less effort\n- Increase profitability\n- Rapid response to changing priorities and customer needs\n- Common language between business and IT teams\n- Cost-effective with lower upfront, development, and maintenance costs\n\n🌟 Key Technology Benefits:\n- One efficient language for all tasks\n- Reduced complexity for development teams\n- AI-powered SDLC toolset\n- Visual full-stack development\n- Enterprise-grade scalable and robust solutions\n- Easily extend and modernize core systems\n\n🎁 Special Offer:\n- 15% discount on any Omnitep Edition for all Astana Hub members and program participants\n- Eligible early-stage startups may receive preferential terms, including product credits (up to 2 months), free training, consulting, and more\n\n🚀 Take your company to the next level with Omnitep!",
